She stated that she had taken lunch to her father, who was ploughing in their Guntathota fields;
after handing over the meals, while returning home, and upon reaching a point about half a kilometer from the fields, A.1 approached her from the opposite direction and held her hand; when she objected and warned that she would inform her father, A.1 allegedly snatched her apparel (voni),
gagged her mouth, dragged her into a cluster of Japanbabul trees, and attempted to rape her;
despite her resistance, A.1 allegedly forced himself upon her, slapped her, and then raped her;
following the incident, she returned home weeping and informed her mother and father;
